---
// IntroAbout.astro
---
<section id="studio" class="intro container">
  <div class="structural-bg" aria-hidden="true">01</div>
  <div class="intro-grid">
    <div class="intro-header reveal-up delay-1">
      <h2 class="text-uppercase font-sans">The Studio</h2>
      <div class="line"></div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="intro-content">
      <p class="intro-text reveal-up delay-2 font-serif italic">
        "We believe that a space should not only be seen but felt. Our approach roots itself in a deep understanding of materiality, light, and context."
      </p>
      
      <div class="intro-desc reveal-up delay-3">
        <p>Founded by Abdul Sattar Jetha, KEAGMAS INTERIORS is a premier luxury interior design studio based in Malabar Hill, Mumbai. We specialize in bespoke residential and commercial architecture, blending timeless aesthetics with uncompromising functional precision.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-xl);
    position: relative;
  }

  .structural-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: -5%;
    font-size: clamp(10rem, 35vw, 40rem);
    font-family: var(--f-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.8;
    color: transparent;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(28, 27, 26, 0.05);
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 3fr 9fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
  }

  .intro-header h2 {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .line {
    width: 40px;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--c-text);
  }

  .intro-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .intro-content {
      gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
  }

  .intro-text {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .intro-desc {
    max-width: 400px;
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.8;
  }
</style>
